<title>USA: Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha hogs $1.00 lower - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barrows and gilts were $1.00 lower</p>
<p>with a top of $60.50 per cwt. - USDA</p>
<p>US  1-3    230-260 lbs    60.50</p>
<p>US  2-3    260-280 lbs    59.50-60.00</p>
<p>Sows: Steady to 2.00 lower. Top 51.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3    350-450 lbs    47.00, few 47.25-47.50</p>
<p>	    450-500 lbs    49.00-50.00</p>
<p>US 2-3    500-650 lbs    51.00</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8723))</p>
</text>
